The root cause was Dexie's own type signature: `Table<T = any, TKey = any, TInsertType = T>`. Writing `Table<Notification>` previously left `TKey` as `any` — entirely invisible to a code search but detectable by a type-level analyser. The fix supplies all three parameters explicitly:

```typescript
// before — TKey silently defaults to `any`
{ [K in ImportableTable]: Table<TableRowMap[K]> }

// after — all three params locked down, no any in scope
{ [K in ImportableTable]: Table<TableRowMap[K], string, TableRowMap[K]> }
```

